---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Insulation Installation',
  provider: { '@type': 'GeneralContractor', '@id': 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/#business', name: 'Purpose Construction', url: 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/' },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'State', name: 'Texas', containedInPlace: { '@type': 'Country', name: 'United States' } },
  description: 'Insulation installation across East Texas: spray foam, blown-in, and batt insulation for attics, walls, and crawl spaces, plus air sealing and R-value assessment.',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Insulation in Lufkin, TX | Purpose Construction"
  description="Insulation installation in Lufkin, TX: spray foam, blown-in and batt for attics, walls and crawl spaces. Free estimates: (936) 255-2235."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Services', href: '/services/' }, { label: 'Exterior Services', href: '/exterior-services/' }, { label: 'Insulation Installation', href: '/insulation-installation/' }]} />
  <PageHero title="Insulation Installation in Lufkin, TX" subtitle="Spray foam, blown-in, and batt insulation for attics, walls, and crawl spaces that cut the cooling load and keep East Texas homes comfortable year-round." tag="Exterior Service" 
    image="/images/insulation-installation-east-texas.jpg"
  />

  <section class="section-padding bg-warm-50">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <SectionHeading tag="Insulation Installation" title="The Right Insulation for East Texas's Hot, Humid Climate" />
          <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal-600">
            <p>East Texas is in a mixed-humid climate zone, where attics can top 140°F in July. In an under-insulated house, that heat and moisture cause comfort and energy problems that don't go away. Before we add anything, we figure out where the insulated boundary of the house should be and which products hold up in Lufkin's humidity.</p>
            <p>Spray foam works best in a hot, humid climate. Open-cell foam in the attic makes an unvented, conditioned attic, which keeps your ductwork inside the insulated part of the house and drops attic temperatures a lot. Blown-in fiberglass or cellulose works well for topping up an attic that falls short of the R-value recommended for East Texas. We use closed-cell spray foam in crawl spaces and rim joists, where keeping moisture out matters as much as the insulation.</p>
            <p>Every insulation job, new build or existing home, starts with an R-value assessment to find where your house is losing the most energy, so your money goes where it does the most good.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
            <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
            <a href="/exterior-services/" class="btn-outline">All Exterior Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/insulation-installation-east-texas-800.webp" alt="Insulation installation across East Texas by Purpose Construction" class="rounded-xl shadow-hero" width="640" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="What's Included" title="Insulation Installation Services" align="center" />
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {['Spray Foam Insulation', 'Blown-In Insulation', 'Batt Insulation', 'Attic Insulation', 'Wall Insulation', 'Crawl Space Insulation', 'Air Sealing', 'R-Value Assessment'].map(item => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-red" aria-hidden="true"></span>{item}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding-sm bg-warm-50 border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Related Services" title="Related Services" />
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {[{ label: 'Window Installation', href: '/window-installation/' }, { label: 'Exterior Services', href: '/exterior-services/' }, { label: 'New Construction', href: '/new-construction/' }].map(link => (
          <a href={link.href} class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-charcoal-900 transition-all duration-200">{link.label} →</a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-gradient-red">
    <div class="container-mid px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="display-md text-white mb-4">Lower Your Energy Bills This Summer</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-base text-white/80">Contact Purpose Construction for a free insulation assessment and estimate. We serve Lufkin and all of East Texas.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost px-8 py-4">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:9362552235" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150">(936) 255-2235</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
